Purpose: Use PCSL BSD client sockets with nonblocking DNS and the FPLinux
 slave-mode readiness adapter. Ignore SIGPIPE and validate setup errors.
 Socket close never blocks the GUI for SO_LINGER. The single-suite Runner
 owns pause/destroy; do not import the upstream AMS SuspendSystem.
 Expose the existing suite access context to the FPLinux launcher.

